  [config] use_ffi_io=true on CPU backend but venv lacks mpi4py / h5py-parallel; falling back to H5PY_ALLGATHER (rank-0 serial write — slow at scale).  Build h5py with HDF5_MPI=ON against the system's parallel HDF5 to get PHDF5_HOST.

